Damai. Oke.

00:36:28.417 --> 00:36:30.500
-Oh, iya. Iya, iya.
-Nggak! Jangan—

00:36:33.750 --> 00:36:35.750
Kukira kamu harus ngelindungin aku.

00:36:35.833 --> 00:36:36.792
Emang.

00:36:37.500 --> 00:36:38.333
Wow.

00:36:41.542 --> 00:36:43.542
Permisi. Permisi.

00:36:44.708 --> 00:36:45.708
Oke, oke.

00:36:46.792 --> 00:36:47.625
Jadi…

00:36:48.292 --> 00:36:50.500
Kenapa kamu tidur di lemari pagi ini?

00:36:51.000 --> 00:36:52.750
Aku punya alasan, tapi…

00:36:55.125 --> 00:36:56.500
Makasih selimutnya.

00:36:56.583 --> 00:36:58.750
-Oke.
-Oh, hai, Bonnie.

00:36:59.958 --> 00:37:01.792
Ini seru. Mau lagi?

00:37:02.375 --> 00:37:04.792
Kita bisa jadiin ini kegiatan rutin, lho.

00:37:06.500 --> 00:37:07.917
Aku seperti Pawang Kuda.

00:37:09.292 --> 00:37:12.208
Bro, kamu hadapi kekacauan
ini sepanjang hidupmu?

00:37:13.250 --> 00:37:14.083
